  },
  "images": {
    "juve1897": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/juve1897.png"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Why do Juventus wear black and white?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "kit",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "yellow",
        "from": {
          "c1": "#ffffff",
          "stripes": "#111111"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, it's because of a club in Nottingham.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "route",
        "bg": "teal",
        "cities": [
          "NOTTINGHAM",
          "TURIN"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Juventus were founded in Turin, in 1897.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "years",
        "bg": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "1897",
            "top": "TURIN",
            "label": "Juventus founded",
            "tick": true,
            "head": "#111111"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And their first proper kit was pink. With a black tie.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "kit",
        "bg": "pink",
        "from": {
          "c1": "#f5a3c7",
          "tie": true
        },
        "label": "PINK"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "By 1903, the story goes, the pink had faded badly.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "kit",
        "bg": "pink",
        "from": {
          "c1": "#f5a3c7",
          "tie": true
        },
        "fade": true,
        "label": "WASHED OUT"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So an Englishman in the team asked a friend back home to send new shirts.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "picture",
        "image": "juve1897",
        "bg": "pink",
        "label": "TURIN · 1903"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His friend supported Notts County.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "kit",
        "bg": "navy",
        "from": {
          "c1": "#ffffff",
          "stripes": "#111111"
        },
        "label": "NOTTS COUNTY"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the parcel that arrived in Turin was full of black and white stripes.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "route",
        "bg": "teal",
        "cities": [
          "NOTTINGHAM",
          "TURIN"
        ],
        "parcel": true
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pink became black and white, and Juventus have worn it ever since.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "kit",
        "bg": "yellow",
        "from": {
          "c1": "#f5a3c7",
          "tie": true
        },
        "to": {
          "c1": "#ffffff",
          "stripes": "#111111"
        },
        "change": true,
        "label": "1903 → TODAY"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Notts County? Founded in 1862, they're the oldest professional club in the world.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "years",
        "bg": "navy",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "1862",
            "top": "NOTTS COUNTY",
            "label": "Oldest professional club",
            "tick": true,
            "head": "#111111"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When Juventus opened their new stadium in 2011, guess who they invited.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "fixture",
        "bg": "yellow",
        "now": {
          "top": "8 SEPTEMBER 2011 · OPENING GAME",
          "teams": "JUVENTUS v ???",
          "foot": "JUVENTUS STADIUM, TURIN"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Notts County.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "fixture",
        "bg": "yellow",
        "cut": true,
        "now": {
          "top": "8 SEPTEMBER 2011 · OPENING GAME",
          "teams": "JUVENTUS 1-1 NOTTS COUNTY",
          "foot": "JUVENTUS STADIUM, TURIN"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}